---
import { affiliateLinks } from "../../../data/affiliateLinks";
---

<section id="pricing" class="bg-gray-50 py-24">

<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">

<div class="text-center">

<span class="rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700">

💰 Pricing

</span>

<h2 class="mt-6 text-5xl font-extrabold">

Which Canva Plan Should You Choose?

</h2>

<p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-xl text-gray-600">

Canva offers a generous free plan, but Canva Pro unlocks
the full power of AI.

</p>

</div>

<div class="mt-20 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">

<div class="rounded-3xl border bg-white p-10">

<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
Free
</h3>

<div class="mt-6 text-6xl font-extrabold">
$0
</div>

<ul class="mt-8 space-y-3">

<li>✅ Basic Design Tools</li>
<li>✅ Templates</li>
<li>✅ Limited AI</li>

</ul>

</div>

<div class="relative rounded-3xl border-2 border-blue-600 bg-white p-10 shadow-2xl scale-105">

<div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-6 py-2 text-white font-bold">

⭐ BEST VALUE

</div>

<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">

Canva Pro

</h3>

<div class="mt-6 text-6xl font-extrabold text-blue-600">

From $15/month

</div>

<div class="mt-6 rounded-xl bg-red-100 p-4 text-center">

🔥 <strong>Exclusive Offer:</strong><br>

Get <strong>50% OFF</strong> your first 3 months through our link.

</div>

<ul class="mt-8 space-y-3">

<li>✅ Magic Studio</li>
<li>✅ Magic Write</li>
<li>✅ AI Images</li>
<li>✅ Background Remover</li>
<li>✅ Premium Templates</li>
<li>✅ Brand Kit</li>

</ul>

<a

href={affiliateLinks.canva}

target="_blank"

rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"

onclick="trackAffiliateClick('Canva AI','Pricing Section')"

class="mt-10 block rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 py-4 text-center font-bold text-white hover:bg-blue-700"

>

🎉 Claim 50% OFF

</a>

</div>

<div class="rounded-3xl border bg-white p-10">

<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
Canva Teams
</h3>

<div class="mt-6 text-6xl font-extrabold">
Custom
</div>

<ul class="mt-8 space-y-3">

<li>✅ Team Collaboration</li>
<li>✅ Admin Controls</li>
<li>✅ Brand Management</li>

</ul>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>